    "short_description": "Telecom Egypt, officially known as Telecom Egypt Company S.A.E., is the primary fixed-line telecommunications operator in Egypt and a leading provider of wholesale telecommunications services. Established in 1854, it is the first telecommunications company in Africa and one of the oldest globally. The company was incorporated in its current form in 1998 and is listed on the Egyptian Exchange and the London Stock Exchange.\n\nTelecom Egypt offers a wide range of services, including fixed voice services, high-speed broadband, mobile services, and entertainment options. It also provides enterprise solutions such as managed ICT services, data center facilities, and smart solutions for businesses. The company operates a significant submarine cable network, connecting Egypt to global destinations, and holds a 45% stake in Vodafone Egypt, enhancing its mobile service offerings. With a strong presence in both domestic and international markets, Telecom Egypt plays a crucial role in the country's digital infrastructure and connectivity.",
